      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RITZA TIANA (4) is progressing well and looks close to another win after hitting the frame last run (29.71) at this track. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from three starts. Rates highly and will give a great sight. CAWBOURNE OZZY (2) is better than last start when fourth (25.31) in a Grade 5 at Goulburn over 440m. Has a strong record from box 2, including four wins. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. PUERILE (1) finished third (30.05) two back at this track but out of the placings last time when 6th there. Form is hard to fault from this box, with a win and three minor placings from four starts. A big run wouldn't surprise. SUMMER ANGEL (7) cannot be overlooked following a recent top-three finish here at this distance.",
